Ok, let's analyze the cool things to wish for in slashem, that you
won't find in nethack:

1) the blessed Wallet of Perseus - artifact bag of holding, 1/6th
weight.
2) a blessed amulet of flying - much cooler than a ring of levitation
3) a blessed figurine of a Solar - like a supercharged Archon
you could also wish for an assault rifle, but it's probably better to
wait until you've found one, since you will also need a lot of
bullets.

Other things you might want to wish for, that also exist in nethack:

1) a blessed saddle - for riding.
2) rings of polymorph/polymorph control + an amulet of unchanging
3) blessed rustproof +2 gauntlets of power - need to get them to +7 to
throw the hammer.
4) a blessed magic harp - especially if there is a tool shop with
charging service.
5) ring of teleport control 
6) magic marker
7) 2 cursed scrolls of genocide - if you've got some gold/identified
gems you can convert a scroll of genocide into INFINITE WISHES in
slashem, using the gypsy abuse.

Note, slashem has the function of "upgrading", where you can dip items
into a potion of gain level to change them into "better" items of the
same type.

